/*---------------------------------------------------------------------------*\
  Benchmark E -- one unit: the sample's isothermal plug-flow reformer.

      feed (1000 K, 1 atm; CH4 : H2O : H2 = 1 : 1 : 0.01) ─► PFR (1 m3) ─► product

  AS THE SAMPLE SHIPS IT: volume 1 m3, "catalyst loading" 0.386 kg/m3 (the
  sample's own number, read as the mass of catalyst per cubic metre of
  reactor on which its kmol/(kg h) rates are scaled -- a bed of 0.386 kg
  per m3 is not a packed bed, and the README says so), isothermal mode,
  the outlet at the inlet's 1000 K.  Choupo's `pfr` takes its isothermal
  temperature from its feed, which is the sample's 1000 K.  The sample's
  Ergun pressure drop (584 Pa over 1 atm, 0.58 %) is NOT reproduced: a
  stated omission (it needs a declared particle and a transport model, and
  moves the outlet by less than the comparison can see).

  THE KINETICS: constant/reactions -- Xu & Froment (1989), reactions I, II
  and III sharing one adsorption denominator, at the article's REFERENCE
  activity (the partially deactivated catalyst its Tables 5-6 describe; the
  fresh-catalyst factor 2.246 is NOT applied, which is also the sample's
  choice).  The three equilibrium constants the article does not print come
  from Choupo's own formation data (system/propsDict).
\*---------------------------------------------------------------------------*/

units
(
    {
        name        PFR;
        type        pfr;
        in          feed;
        outputs     ( product );
        operation
        {
            V_R              1 m3;           // the sample's reactor volume
            nSteps           25600;          // RK4 steps, GRID-CONVERGED (2026-10-25): the inlet carries
                                             // 1 % H2 and every rate divides by p_H2^n, so the first
                                             // millimetres are stiff.  CH4 conversion 0.7490 / 0.7516 /
                                             // 0.7549 / 0.7554 / 0.7554 at 400 / 1600 / 6400 / 25600 /
                                             // 102400 steps -- 400 (the first choice) was 0.85 % short
                                             // of its own limit, more than the gap it was compared on
            thermalMode      isothermal;     // at the feed's 1000 K
            catalystLoading  0.386;          // kg/m3, the sample's value (README)
        }
        reactions   ( steamReforming  waterGasShift  overallReforming );
    }
);
